{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20024","headline":"赠苏州韦郎中使君 · 孟郊","name":"赠苏州韦郎中使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢客吟一声，霜落羣听清。\n文含元气柔，鼓动万物轻。\n嘉木依性植，曲枝亦不生。\n尘埃徐庾词，金玉曹刘名。\n章句作雅正，江山益鲜明。\n萍苹一浪草，菰蒲片池荣。\n曾是康乐咏，如今搴其英。\n顾惟菲薄质，亦愿将此幷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}